{
  "dom_id": "step-e1445",
  "name": "Example: Graphing a Combination of Horizontal and Vertical Translations",
  "problem": "Identify the equation of the graph shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/36a2a45f6078cdf04b798c39b6382c1f40411375a3f16ef77e996b39aa0009b3.png)",
  "worked_solution": "Remember that the graph of $y=(x-h)^2+k$ is a translation of the standard parabola $y=x^2$ by\n\n- $h$ units right, and\n\n- $k$ units up.\n\nThe vertex of $y=(x-h)^2+k$ is located at $(h,k).$\n\nHere, the parabola is translated $2$ units *left*, so we have $h=-2.$ The parabola is also translated $1$ unit up, so we have $k=1.$ We can also see that the vertex is at $(-2,1),$ so again we must have $h=-2$ and $k=1.$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the graph is:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =(x-(-2))^{2}+1 \\\\ y & =(x+2)^{2}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e1445\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Graphing a Combination of Horizontal and Vertical Translations</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e1445\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Identify the equation of the graph shown below. </p>\n<div id=\"graphic-a6de0b39df52bcdd1b4d53f422b1a8da\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/a6de0b39df52bcdd1b4d53f422b1a8da\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n         